abstract: >-
  MetacatUI is a client-side web interface for querying Metacat servers and
  other servers that implement the DataONE REST API. Currently, it is used as
  the basis for the KNB Data Repository, the NSF Arctic Data Center, the
  DataONE federation, and other repositories. MetacatUI is an open source,
  community project. We welcome contributions in many forms, including code,
  graphics, documentation, bug reports, testing, etc. Use the discussion list
  to discuss these contributions with us.
